Cell["\<\
On the 4-cycle with the walk 2, 1, 4, the vertex 3 is equally near to 2 and \
to 4. The rules read the tie differently:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"1c0022b3-39de-49e6-9c57-222dadb08de6"],

